The fix is complete. Summary:

**Change** — `tpl/tplimpl/embedded/templates/_default/_markup/render-image.html:8-10`: the embedded image render hook built its attribute dict only from `.Text`, `.Destination`, and `.Title`, silently dropping markdown attributes like `{.foo #bar}`. It now merges `.Attributes` (populated from the goldmark AST in markup/goldmark/render_hooks.go:193) into that dict:

```
{{- $attributes := dict "alt" .Text "src" $src "title" .Title -}}
{{- range $k, $v := .Attributes -}}
  {{- $attributes = merge $attributes (dict $k $v) -}}
{{- end -}}
```

